\newlabel{fig:ams_subtypes}{{6}{6}{Left: PosCT rate by AMS subtype---``Agitated'' (15.4\%) is more than double ``Sleepy'' (7.6\%). Right: AMS subtype $\times $ injury severity interaction. Agitated + high-impact reaches 23.3\%}{figure.6}{}}
